  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated agricultural project for the construction of a CIPA in V lingara(Kolda region) and capacity building at ISEP Bignona(Ziguinchor region)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of CIPA Kolda educational and administrative facilities; Supply of agricultural and educational equipment; Establishment of operation plan and pilot operation; Introduction and operation of a student support center; Development of agricultural education curriculum; Development and operation of teacher capacity building program; Invitational training</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To expand employment and use of agricultural technology through agricultural vocational training and technical capacity building in Southern Senegal&#xb18d;&#xc5c5;&#xc9c1;&#xc5c5;&#xd6c8;&#xb828; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xac15;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc591;&#xc9c8;&#xc758; &#xb18d;&#xc5c5;&#xc778;&#xb825; &#xc591;&#xc131;</narrative>
